# Realjet

> Realjet (Changsha Ruijie Machinery Technology Co., Ltd) engineers and manufactures turnkey precast concrete production lines, project-specific steel moulds and formwork, and custom fabricated machinery components. Its scope can include process planning, mechanical design, manufacturing, installation support and commissioning.

Realjet serves infrastructure contractors, precast producers and machinery manufacturers. Project-specific dimensions, functions, interfaces, capacity and delivery boundaries are confirmed through technical review before manufacture. The primary site language is English; selected precast-production-line and privacy pages are also available in Indonesian, Arabic, Russian, Chinese, French and Spanish.

## Main pages

- [Home](https://realjetech.com/): Overview of Realjet's two core businesses and engineering capabilities.
- [Precast concrete production equipment](https://realjetech.com/products/): Equipment modules for project-specific precast concrete production lines.
- [Precast concrete moulds and formwork](https://realjetech.com/precast-concrete-molds/): Steel mould systems organized by precast component and application.
- [Custom machinery component manufacturing](https://realjetech.com/marketing/contract_manufacturing/): Contract manufacturing for welded, machined and assembled machinery components.
- [Precast concrete production lines](https://realjetech.com/marketing/precast-beam-factory/en/): Turnkey production-line planning, equipment, installation and commissioning.
- [Spun pipe piles production line](https://realjetech.com/marketing/spun-pipe-piles-production-ine/): Turnkey equipment and plant integration for prestressed spun concrete pipe piles.
- [Engineering insights](https://realjetech.com/insights/): Buyer guides, RFQ checklists and technical planning articles.
- [Contact Realjet](https://realjetech.com/contact/): Project enquiry form and company contact details.

